<DocsExample TExample="ButtonGroupSelectionExample" Title="Single selection" Description="Bind SelectedKey to track the active item. Each NTButtonGroupItem needs a unique Key." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonGroupConnectedExample" Title="Connected group with icons" Description="DisplayType Connected joins the buttons into one segmented control. SelectionRequired keeps one item selected at all times." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonGroupMultipleExample" Title="Multiple selection" Description="SelectionMode Multiple lets items toggle independently. Bind SelectedKeys to read the collection." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonGroupActionsExample" Title="Action-only group" Description="SelectionMode None turns the group into plain buttons. Handle OnSelectionChanged to react to a press, and disable single items with Disabled." />
